/* ---------- WALLPAPER: behind the conversation ----------
   One fixed layer behind the whole room, under the bar, the thread and the box you write in, and
   the same layer in a conversation that floats as a window or sits in the other half (each of
   those is a page of its own). Every wallpaper has a light and a dark version, and each is quiet
   enough that a line of the room laid straight on it still reads: the bubbles keep their own
